B.TH=new A.ei("V","Evals, Review & Batch",B.lm,B.CL,"Numbers doing the talking: percentages, SLA hours, reviewer capacity, \u201cmost cost-effective\u201d, Batch API.","Do the arithmetic before judging vibes. Batch interval + 24h \u2264 SLA. Split urgent from patient. Fix only what failed, and fix the actual error. Never trust an aggregate metric \u2014 segment it, and route scarce review by calibrated confidence.","What varies is the resource being budgeted: hours (28, 58), dollars (55), reviewer attention (60), or trust (21, 59).",1,"evals")
