B.TF=new A.ei("M","Multi-Agent Orchestration",B.C7,B.CC,"A cast of named agents \u2014 coordinator, web search, document analysis, synthesis \u2014 and something breaking between them.","Two tensions, two rules. (1) Handoff loss: subagents are sealed; whatever must survive a handoff travels as structured data the coordinator explicitly passes. (2) Delegation style: give subagents goals + quality criteria, never step-by-step scripts.","What varies is WHAT got lost (dates, citations, findings, the delegation itself) or WHERE control sits (over-scripted subagent, coordinator doing too little or too much).",2,"multiAgent")
