B.TC=new A.ei("C","Claude Code: Sessions & Exploration",B.Bq,B.CI,"Claude Code tool names (Grep, Read, Edit), file counts, minutes elapsed, or session verbs: resume, fork, continue, /clear.","Exploration: targeted and incremental \u2014 trace structure from entry points; never bulk-read, never start blind-fresh. Sessions: small known change \u2192 resume + inform. Two futures from one past \u2192 fork. Know the name \u2192 --resume it. Degrading context \u2192 subagents or a scratchpad file.","What varies is the failure mode: stale files, rot mid-session, an un-anchorable Edit, or picking the right resume/fork/fresh move.",3,"claudeCode")
