B.TE=new A.ei("S","Support Agent: Tools & Escalation",B.ll,B.C6,"lookup_order / process_refund / escalate_to_human, a quoted frustrated customer, refund dollar amounts.","Escalation is judgment-guided by criteria (customer asks, policy exception, no progress) \u2014 except hard compliance thresholds, which get code/hooks, never a louder prompt. Handoffs are structured summaries, not transcripts. Context gets compacted to the fields that matter.","What varies is the trigger: explicit human demand (honor it), instantly-fixable issue (offer both paths), hard $ threshold (hook), stale data (fresh session + summary).",4,"supportAgent")
